        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Large Garden**\n**Great Location **\n\nByrne Malone are delighted to present 1653 Páirc Mhuire to the market for sale by private treaty. This three-bedroom property, currently configured as a two-bedroom home, is ideally situated within the mature and peaceful residential estate of Páirc Mhuire. Overlooking a large green area, the property is within walking distance of Newbridge Town Centre and an excellent range of amenities, including primary and secondary schools, Whitewater Shopping Centre, Tesco, Dunnes Stores, as well as a wide selection of cafés, pubs and restaurants. For commuters, Newbridge Train Station and the M7 motorway are both just a short drive away, making this an excellent location for those travelling to Dublin and surrounding areas.\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance hallway, sitting room, kitchen, two bedrooms and a family bathroom.\nUpon entering the property, the sitting room is located to the left of the hallway. This bright and welcoming room features wooden flooring, a feature fireplace and two large picture windows, allowing plenty of natural light to fill the space. The newly fitted kitchen offers ample storage and overlooks the rear garden. A door provides direct access to the outdoor space, making the garden easily accessible from the kitchen. \nUpstairs, there are two bright and airy bedrooms along with a family bathroom, which is neatly tiled. \nExternally, the property benefits from a front driveway providing off-street parking. To the rear is a large garden, offering excellent outdoor space and potential, together with a block-built shed providing useful additional storage. A side entrance provides convenient access to the rear garden.\nPáirc Mhuire is a well-established and popular residential development, conveniently located close to a wide range of amenities, including schools, shops, bars, restaurants, Newbridge Silverware and Whitewater Shopping Centre.Commuters will appreciate the property's excellent connectivity, with easy access to both the M7 motorway and Newbridge Train Station, both only minutes away.\n1653 Páirc Mhuire represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a home with excellent potential in a highly convenient and well-established location. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\n"
